{"type":"message","id":"d57f238d","parentId":"fabb9399","timestamp":"2026-04-02T01:10:16.043Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-02 09:10 GMT+8] An async command did not run.\nDo not run the command again.\nThere is no new command output.\nDo not mention, summarize, or reuse output from any earlier run in this session.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec denied (gateway id=a91ce469-54df-4841-9374-c419cc9eea10, approval-timeout): set -euo pipefail\nfor n in 54952 54964 55008 55013; do\n  echo \"=== $n ===\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/$n --jq '{number,title,state,updated_at,comments,html_url}'\n  echo \"--comments--\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/$n/comments --jq 'sort_by(.created_at) | reverse | .[:5] | map({user:.user.login,created_at,updated_at,body})'\n  if [ \"$n\" = \"55008\" ] || [ \"$n\" = \"55013\" ]; then\n    echo \"--reviews--\"\n    timeout 15s gh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/$n/reviews --jq 'sort_by(.submitted_at) | reverse | .[:5] | map({user:.user.login,submitted_at,state,body})'\n  fi\n  echo\n done\n\nReply to the user in a helpful way.\nExplain that the command did not run and why.\nDo not claim there is new command output."}],"timestamp":1775092215911}}
